    "question": "<p>What will come opposite to face containing &#39;*&#39;?</p>\n\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/tb-img/production/23/06/F1_Savita_State%20Govt._29-6-23_D16.png\" style=\"width: 145px; height: 109px;\" /></p>\n",
    "question_hi": "<p>&#39;*&#39; वाले फलक के विपरीत फलक पर क्या आएगा?</p>\n\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/tb-img/production/23/06/F1_Savita_State%20Govt._29-6-23_D16.png\" style=\"width: 145px; height: 109px;\" /></p>\n",
