    ],
    "correct": 1,
    "solution": "<p>According to the given information, the logic here is,</p>\n\n<p><strong>As Two opposite faces are never together or adjacent to each other,</strong></p>\n\n<p>Thus,</p>\n\n<p>There is a pattern in which unfolded dice occur opposite to each other.</p>\n\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/tb-img/production/23/06/F1_Savita_State%20Govt._29-6-23_D17.png\" style=\"color:  (33, 37, 41); width: 158px; height: 157px;\" /></p>\n\n<table border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"1\" cellspacing=\"1\" style=\"color:  (33, 37, 41); width: 300px;\">\n\t<tbody>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-weight: 700;\">Face</span></td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-weight: 700;\">Opposite</span></td>\n\t\t</tr>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\">*</td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\">+</td>\n\t\t</tr>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\">%</td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\">#</td>\n\t\t</tr>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\">&amp;</td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\">-</td>\n\t\t</tr>\n\t</tbody>\n</table>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p style=\"color:  (33, 37, 41);\"><strong>Thus,&quot;+&quot; is opposite to &quot;*&quot;.</strong></p>\n\n<p>Hence, the correct answer is<strong> &quot;+&quot;.</strong></p>\n",
    "solution_hi": "<p>दी गई जानकारी के अनुसार, यहाँ <span style=\"\">अनुसरित </span> तर्क है,</p>\n\n<p><strong>चूँकि, दो विपरीत </strong><span style=\"color:  (33, 37, 41); font-weight: 700; text-align: center;\">फलक </span><strong> कभी एक साथ या एक दूसरे के निकट नहीं होते हैं,</strong></p>\n\n<p>इसी प्रकार,</p>\n\n<p>एक पैटर्न है जिसमें खुला पासा एक दूसरे के विपरीत होता है।</p>\n\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/tb-img/production/23/06/F1_Savita_State%20Govt._29-6-23_D17.png\" style=\"color:  (33, 37, 41); width: 158px; height: 157px;\" /></p>\n\n<table border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"1\" cellspacing=\"1\" style=\"color:  (33, 37, 41); width: 300px;\">\n\t<tbody>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\"><b>फलक </b></td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\"><b>विपरीत </b><span style=\"font-weight: bolder; text-align: center;\">फलक </span></td>\n\t\t</tr>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\">*</td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\">+</td>\n\t\t</tr>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\">%</td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\">#</td>\n\t\t</tr>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color:  (33, 37, 41); text-align: center;\">&amp;</span></td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\">-</td>\n\t\t</tr>\n\t</tbody>\n</table>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p style=\"color:  (33, 37, 41);\"><strong>इस प्रकार, &quot;+&quot;, &quot;*&quot; के विपरीत </strong><span style=\"color:  (33, 37, 41); font-weight: 700; text-align: center;\">फलक पर होगा</span><strong> ।</strong></p>\n\n<p>अतः, सही उत्तर <strong> &quot;+&quot; </strong>है।</p>\n",
