    "question": "<p>How many squares and rectangles are present in the figure?</p>\n\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/tb-img/production/25/07/25-7-2025%20IMG-518%20-113.png\" style=\"width: 103px; height: 101px;\" /></p>\n",
