    "correct": 3,
    "solution": "<p>The number of&nbsp;squares and rectangles in the figure are shown below:</p>\n\n<p>1) Total number of squares as marked below = (5 + 1) = 6</p>\n\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/tb-img/production/25/07/25-7-2025%20IMG-518%20-114.png\" style=\"width: 328px; height: 138px;\" /></p>\n\n<p>Number of squares &rarr; 1<sup>2</sup>&nbsp;+ 2<sup>2</sup>&nbsp;<span style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">&rarr; (1 + 4) = 5</span></p>\n\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/tb-img/production/25/07/25-7-2025%20IMG-518%20-115.png\" style=\"width: 103px; height: 101px;\" /></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">Number of squares&nbsp;</span><span style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">&rarr;</span><span style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">&nbsp;1</span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">2) Total&nbsp;</span>number of rectangles&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/tb-img/production/25/07/25-7-2025%20IMG-518%20-116.png\" style=\"width: 234px; height: 101px;\" /></p>\n\n<p>As marked, there are total 4 rectangles.</p>\n\n<p>Thus, total number&nbsp;<span style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">of&nbsp;squares and rectangles in the figure are (6 + 4) = 10</span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">Hence, <strong>&quot;Option 3&quot;</strong> is the correct answer.</span></p>\n",
    "solution_hi": "<p>आकृति में वर्गों और आयतों की संख्या नीचे दिखाई गई है:</p>\n\n<p>1)&nbsp;वर्गों की&nbsp;<span style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">कुल</span> संख्या नीचे चिह्नित की गई है = (5 + 1) = 6</p>\n\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/tb-img/production/25/07/25-7-2025%20IMG-518%20-114.png\" style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41); width: 328px; height: 138px;\" /></p>\n\n<p>वर्गों की संख्या &rarr; 1<sup>2</sup> + 2<sup>2</sup> <span style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">&rarr; (1 + 4) = 5</span></p>\n\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/tb-img/production/25/07/25-7-2025%20IMG-518%20-115.png\" style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41); width: 103px; height: 101px;\" /></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">वर्गों की संख्या </span><span style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">&rarr;</span><span style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\"> 1</span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">2)&nbsp;</span>आयतों की&nbsp;<span style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">कुल</span> संख्या:</p>\n\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/tb-img/production/25/07/25-7-2025%20IMG-518%20-116.png\" style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41); width: 234px; height: 101px;\" /></p>\n\n<p>जैसा कि चिह्नित किया गया है, कुल 4 आयत हैं।</p>\n\n<p>इस प्रकार, आकृति में वर्गों और आयतों की कुल संख्या (6 + 4) = 10 है।</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">इसलिए,&nbsp;सही उत्तर&nbsp;<strong>&quot;विकल्प 3&quot;</strong>&nbsp;है।</span></p>\n",
