    "solution": "<p style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\"><span style=\"font-weight: bolder;\">Given:&nbsp;</span>A cube is painted and cut into 125 smaller and identical cubes by making the minimum possible number of cuts.&nbsp;​</p>\n\n<p style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">The cube is cut into 125 small cubes we have :-</p>\n\n<p style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">n =&nbsp;&radic;125&nbsp;&rarr; 5</p>\n\n<p style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">Number of 0&nbsp;faces painted cube = <span style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">(n - 2)</span><span style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41); position: relative; line-height: 0; vertical-align: baseline; top: -0.5em; font-size:10.5px;\">3</span>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\"><span style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">=&nbsp;</span><span style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">(5 - 2)</span><span style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41); position: relative; line-height: 0; vertical-align: baseline; top: -0.5em; font-size:10.5px;\">3</span></p>\n\n<p style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\"><span style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">=&nbsp;</span><span style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">(3)</span><span style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41); position: relative; line-height: 0; vertical-align: baseline; top: -0.5em; font-size:10.5px;\">3</span><span style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n\n<p style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">= <strong>27</strong></p>\n\n<p style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">Hence,&nbsp;<span style=\"font-weight: bolder;\">&quot;Option 4&quot;</span>&nbsp;is the correct answer.</p>\n\n<p style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\"><span style=\"display: flex; gap: 6px; align-items: center;\"><span style=\"display: flex;gap: 6px;align-items: center;\"><img height=\"26px\" src=\"https://cdn.testbook.com/resources/lms_creative_elements/additional-information-image.png\" width=\"26px\" /><strong><span style=\"vertical-align: middle;font-size: 21px;\"><u>Additional Information</u></span></strong></span>&nbsp;</span></p>\n\n<p style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://cdn.testbook.com/images/production/quesImages/qImage67b1679ea2aedc08a62cff5b.png\" /><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://cdn.testbook.com/1760703357069-IMG-970-Arpit-39.png/1760703359.png\" style=\"width: 317px; height: 154px;\" /></p>\n\n<p style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">Number of 3&nbsp;faces painted cube = 8 (Because of 8 corners)</p>\n\n<p>Number of 2&nbsp;faces painted cube =&nbsp;(n - 2)&nbsp;&times; number of edges <span style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">&rarr;</span> (5 - 2)&nbsp;&times; 12&nbsp;&rArr; 36</p>\n\n<p style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">Number of 1&nbsp;faces painted cube = (n - 2)<span style=\"position: relative; line-height: 0; vertical-align: baseline; top: -0.5em; font-size:10.5px;\">2</span>&nbsp;&times; number of edges&nbsp;<span style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">&rarr;</span> (5 - 2)<span style=\"position: relative; line-height: 0; vertical-align: baseline; top: -0.5em; font-size:10.5px;\">2</span>&nbsp;&times; 6&nbsp;<span style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">&rArr; 54</span></p>\n",
    "solution_hi": "<p style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\"><span style=\"font-weight: bolder;\">दिया गया है:</span> एक घन को रंगा जाता है और न्यूनतम संभव कटौती करके 125 छोटे और समान घनों में काटा जाता है।</p>\n\n<p style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">घन को 125 छोटे घनों में काटा जाता है, हमारे पास है:-</p>\n\n<p style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">n = &radic;125 &rarr; 5</p>\n\n<p style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">0 फलक वाले रंगे हुए घनों की संख्या = <span style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">(n - 2)</span><span style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41); position: relative; line-height: 0; vertical-align: baseline; top: -0.5em; font-size:10.5px;\">3</span></p>\n\n<p style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\"><span style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">= </span><span style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">(5 - 2)</span><span style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41); position: relative; line-height: 0; vertical-align: baseline; top: -0.5em; font-size:10.5px;\">3</span></p>\n\n<p style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\"><span style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">= </span><span style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">(3)</span><span style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41); position: relative; line-height: 0; vertical-align: baseline; top: -0.5em; font-size:10.5px;\">3</span><span style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\"> </span><span style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\"> </span></p>\n\n<p style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">= <strong>27</strong></p>\n\n<p style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">इसलिए, <span style=\"font-weight: bolder;\">&quot;विकल्प 4&quot;</span> सही उत्तर है।</p>\n\n<p style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\"><span style=\"display: flex; gap: 6px; align-items: center;\"><span style=\"display: flex;gap: 6px;align-items: center;\"><img height=\"26px\" src=\"https://cdn.testbook.com/resources/lms_creative_elements/additional-information-image.png\" width=\"26px\" /><u style=\"font-weight: bolder; font-family: var(--bs-body-font-family); font-size: var(--bs-body-font-size); text-align: var(--bs-body-text-align);\">Additional Information</u></span></span><span style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"display: flex; gap: 6px; align-items: center;\"> </span></p>\n\n<p style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://cdn.testbook.com/1760703357069-IMG-970-Arpit-39.png/1760703359.png\" style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41); width: 317px; height: 154px;\" /></p>\n\n<p style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">3 फलक वाले रंगे हुए घनों की संख्या = 8 (8 कोनों के कारण)</p>\n\n<p>2 फलक वाले रंगे हुए घनों की संख्या = (n - 2) <span style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">&times;</span> किनारों की संख्या <span style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">&rarr;</span> (5 - 2) <span style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">&times;</span> 12 &rArr; 36</p>\n\n<p style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">1 फलक वाले रंगे हुए घनों की संख्या = (n - 2)<span style=\"position: relative; line-height: 0; vertical-align: baseline; top: -0.5em; font-size:10.5px;\">2</span> <span style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">&times;</span> किनारों की संख्या <span style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">&rarr;</span> (5 - 2)<span style=\"position: relative; line-height: 0; vertical-align: baseline; top: -0.5em; font-size:10.5px;\">2</span> <span style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">&times;</span> 6 <span style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">&rArr; 54</span></p>\n",
