    "question": "<p>The four different positions of dice are given below:</p>\n\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/tb-img/production/24/04/F7_SSC_Savita_12-04-23_D53.png\" style=\"width: 334px; height: 111px;\" /></p>\n\n<p>Which number is on the face opposite of 6?</p>\n",
    "question_hi": "<p>पासे की चार अलग-अलग स्थितियाँ नीचे दी गई हैं:</p>\n\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/tb-img/production/24/04/F7_SSC_Savita_12-04-23_D53.png\" style=\"width: 334px; height: 111px;\" /></p>\n\n<p>कौन सी संख्या 6 के विपरीत फलक पर है?</p>\n",
    "options": [
      "3",
      "2",
      "1",
      "4",
