    "solution": "<p><span style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">From the given open Dice:</span></p>\n\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/tb-img/production/24/04/F3_SSC_Savita_05-04-23_D47.png\" style=\"width: 180px; height: 116px;\" /></p>\n\n<p style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">Two blanks are on opposite sides.</p>\n\n<p style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">One blank and one cross are on opposite sides.</p>\n\n<p style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">One Filled and the circle&nbsp;are on opposite sides.</p>\n\n<p>And, two opposite sides can not be the adjacent surfaces, so it can&#39;t be shown in a dice.</p>\n\n<p>Now,</p>\n\n<p>Option 1)&nbsp;<img alt=\"\" src=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/tb-img/production/24/04/F3_SSC_Savita_05-04-23_D48.png\" style=\"width: 81px; height: 81px;\" /><span style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41); font-weight: 700;\">&rarr;&nbsp;</span><span style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">Can not be made, because the f</span><span style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">illed one and the circle are on opposite sides.</span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">Option 2)&nbsp;</span><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/tb-img/production/24/04/F3_SSC_Savita_05-04-23_D49.png\" style=\"width: 81px; height: 81px;\" /><span style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41); font-weight: 700;\">&rarr;&nbsp;</span><span style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">Can not be made, because the f</span>illed one and the circle are on opposite sides.</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">Option 3)&nbsp;</span><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/tb-img/production/24/04/F3_SSC_Savita_05-04-23_D50.png\" style=\"width: 82px; height: 81px;\" /><span style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41); font-weight: 700;\">&rarr;&nbsp;Can be made, because all the surfaces are adjacent sides.</span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">Option 4)&nbsp;</span><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/tb-img/production/24/04/F3_SSC_Savita_05-04-23_D51.png\" style=\"width: 81px; height: 81px;\" /><span style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41); font-weight: 700;\">&rarr;&nbsp;Can be made, because all the surfaces are adjacent sides.</span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">Hence, the correct answer is&nbsp;</span><span style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41); font-weight: bolder;\">&quot;Option 4&quot;</span><span style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">.</span></p>\n",
    "solution_hi": "<p>दिए गए खुले पासे से:</p>\n\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/tb-img/production/24/04/F3_SSC_Savita_05-04-23_D47.png\" style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41); width: 180px; height: 116px;\" /></p>\n\n<p>दो रिक्त स्थान विपरीत दिशा में हैं।</p>\n\n<p>एक रिक्त&nbsp;<span style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">स्थान</span> और एक क्रॉस विपरीत दिशा में हैं।</p>\n\n<p>एक भरा हुआ&nbsp;<span style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">स्थान</span> और वृत्त विपरीत दिशा में है।</p>\n\n<p>और, दो सम्मुख&nbsp;भुजाएँ आसन्न फलक&nbsp;नहीं हो सकती हैं, इसलिए इसे पासे में नहीं दर्शाया जा सकता है।</p>\n\n<p>अब,</p>\n\n<p>विकल्प 1)&nbsp;<img alt=\"\" src=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/tb-img/production/24/04/F3_SSC_Savita_05-04-23_D48.png\" style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41); width: 81px; height: 81px;\" /><span style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41); font-weight: 700;\">&rarr;&nbsp;</span>नहीं बनाया जा सकता है, क्योंकि भरा हुआ स्थान&nbsp;और वृत्त विपरीत दिशा में हैं।</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">विकल्प&nbsp; 2)&nbsp;</span><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/tb-img/production/24/04/F3_SSC_Savita_05-04-23_D49.png\" style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41); width: 81px; height: 81px;\" /><span style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41); font-weight: 700;\">&rarr;&nbsp;</span>नहीं बनाया जा सकता है, क्योंकि भरा हुआ स्थान&nbsp;और वृत्त विपरीत दिशा में हैं।</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">विकल्प&nbsp; 3)&nbsp;</span><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/tb-img/production/24/04/F3_SSC_Savita_05-04-23_D50.png\" style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41); width: 82px; height: 81px;\" /><span style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41); font-weight: 700;\">&rarr;&nbsp;</span><strong>बनाया जा सकता है, क्योंकि सभी फलक&nbsp;आसन्न भुजाएँ हैं।</strong></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">विकल्प&nbsp; 4)&nbsp;</span><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/tb-img/production/24/04/F3_SSC_Savita_05-04-23_D51.png\" style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41); width: 81px; height: 81px;\" /><span style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41); font-weight: 700;\">&rarr;&nbsp;</span><strong>बनाया जा सकता है, क्योंकि सभी </strong><span style=\"font-weight: bolder;\">फलक</span><strong> आसन्न भुजाएँ हैं।</strong></p>\n\n<p>अतः&nbsp;सही उत्तर <strong>&quot;विकल्प 4&quot; </strong>है।</p>\n",
    "marks": "0.97"
  }
]